irection":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.031","text":"I can notice when I am acting to avoid disapproval.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.032","text":"I value informed choice over pressure to participate.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.033","text":"I can notice what makes ordinary experiences enjoyable.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.034","text":"I allow myself to prefer subtle pleasure to intensity.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.035","text":"I can receive affection without needing to escalate intimacy.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.036","text":"I can name a sensory preference without embarrassment.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.037","text":"I can enjoy creativity without worrying about productivity.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.038","text":"I allow desire to vary rather than forcing consistency.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.039","text":"I can recognise when closeness feels genuinely inviting.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.040","text":"I can appreciate rest as a valid source of enjoyment.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.041","text":"I can notice when my attention drifts.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.042","text":"I can return to a chosen focus without scolding myself.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.043","text":"I can remain curious about an unfamiliar experience.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.044","text":"I can take a mindful pause during ordinary activities.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.045","text":"I can observe a thought without treating it as a command.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.046","text":"I can tell when a practice is becoming mentally tiring.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.047","text":"I can adjust the length of meditation to my needs.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.048","text":"I am willing to pause if concentration feels overwhelming.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.049","text":"I can choose a small action aligned with my priorities.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.050","text":"I can admit when I need assistance.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.051","text":"I can begin imperfectly rather than waiting for certainty.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.052","text":"I notice when other people’s expectations obscure my wishes.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.053","text":"I can express a preference respectfully.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.054","text":"I can revise a goal when my circumstances change.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.055","text":"I can celebrate effort without requiring a dramatic result.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.056","text":"I can protect time for restoration.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.057","text":"I can explain why a practice matters to me personally.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.058","text":"I can question a tradition while still respecting it.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.059","text":"I can translate an insight into an everyday choice.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.060","text":"I allow my understanding of spirituality to evolve.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.061","text":"I can participate in meaningful rituals without claiming proof of supernatural effects.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.062","text":"I can choose a secular approach if it fits me better.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.063","text":"I can separate my values from someone else’s approval.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"},{"id":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait.064","text":"I can integrate experiences without needing a fixed label for myself.","required":true,"direction":"higher-reported-resource"}],"optionalContext":[],"suggestedRepeatDays":30,"contentHash":"sha256:4c67772ab348caff6185bec5306145bd5e058269e8d9650636949f4db2fa8d4d"},{"id":"c7a0000f-7e2d-4a00-8d11-202610170002","key":"hh-tantric-personality-portrait","version":"v1","instrumentLocale":"ru","translationVersion":"hh-ru-v1","timeframe":"general-self-description","scoringKey":"configured","scoringVersion":"v1","resultVer